.\n— 3〉 Gegenstand der Ehre, Respectsperson.\n— 4〉 gefälliges oder angenehmes Wesen, Gunst.\n— 5〉 Name [] verschiedener Sāman ĀRṢ. BR.\n— 6〉 *nach NIGH. = उदक, अन्न und धन.", "gloss_language": "de"}, {"gloss": "2. यश꣫स्\n— 1〉 Adj.\n — a〉 ansehnlich, schön, würdig, herrlich. Compar. यश꣫स्तर (ṚV. 8,2,22. 9,97,3), Superl. यश꣫स्तम.\n — b〉 angesehen, geehrt.\n — c〉 angenehm, werth.\n— 2〉 m. N. pr. eines Mannes. — यशसा꣫ auch fehlerhaft für य꣫शसा.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "yasasa": [{"id": "yaSasa", "headword": "यशस", "headword_slp1": "yaSasa", "fold": "yasasa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "यशस n. = 1. य꣫शस् in देवयशस꣫ (Nachtr. 3), मनुष्ययशस꣫ und श्रीयशस꣫.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "yasasin": [{"id": "yaSasin", "headword": "यशसिन्", "headword_slp1": "yaSasin", "fold": "yasasin", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "यशसिन् Adj. in देवयशसि꣫न् (Nachtr. 3) und मनुष्ययशसि꣫न्.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "yasaskara": [{"id": "yaSaskara", "headword": "यशस्कर", "headword_slp1": "yaSaskara", "fold": "yasaskara", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "— 1〉 Adj. (f. ई) Ruhm verleihend, ruhmvoll, — für (im Comp. vorangehend).\n— 2〉 m. N. pr. verschiedener Männer.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["यशस्करः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["yaSaskaraH"]}], "yasaskarasvamin": [{"id": "yaSaskarasvAmin", "headword": "यशस्करस्वामिन्", "headword_slp1": "yaSaskarasvAmin", "fold": "yasaskarasvamin", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "यशस्करस्वामिन् m. N. pr. eines von einem Yaśaskara errichteten Heiligthums.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "yasaskama": [{"id": "yaSaskAma", "headword": "यशस्काम", "headword_slp1": "yaSaskAma", "fold": "yasaskama", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "य꣫शस्काम\n— 1〉 Adj. ehrbegierig.\n— 2〉 m. N. pr. eines Bodhisattva.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "yasaskamy": [{"id": "yaSaskAmy", "headword": "यशस्काम्य्", "headword_slp1": "yaSaskAmy", "fold": "yasaskamy", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "!√यशस्काम्य्, ˚म्यति nach Ruhm verlangen BHAṬṬ.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "yasaskft": [{"id": "yaSaskft", "headword": "यशस्कृत्", "headword_slp1": "yaSaskft", "fold": "yasaskft", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "यशस्कृ꣫त् Adj. Ansehen verleihend.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "yasasya": [{"id": "yaSasya", "headword": "यशस्य", "headword_slp1": "yaSasya", "fold": "yasasya", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "यशस्य॑\n— 1〉 Adj.\n — a〉 Ansehen gebend, ruhmvoll.\n — b〉 stattlich, anständig aussehend CARAKA. 5,12.\n — c〉 geehrt.\n— 2〉 *f. यशस्या\n — a〉 eine best. Knolle = ऋद्धि RĀJAN. 5,28.\n — b〉 = जीवन्ती (eine best. Pflanze) RĀJAN. 3,25.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "yasasyu": [{"id": "yaSasyu", "headword": "यशस्यु", "headword_slp1": "yaSasyu", "fold": "yasasyu", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "यशस्यु꣫ Adj. Gunst suchend.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "yasasvant": [{"id": "yaSasvant", "headword": "यशस्वन्त्", "headword_slp1": "yaSasvant", "fold": "yasasvant", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "य꣫शस्वन्त्\n— 1〉 Adj.\n — a〉 ansehnlich, schön, herrlich, würdig.\n — b〉 ruhmvoll, ehrenvoll.\n — c〉 angenehm, werth.\n— 2〉 f. यशस्वती N. pr. eines Frauenzimmers.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["यशस्वत्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["yaSasvat"]}], "yasasvin": [{"id": "yaSasvin", "headword": "यशस्विन्", "headword_slp1": "yaSasvin", "fold": "yasasvin", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "यशस्वि꣫न्\n— 1〉 Adj.\n — a〉 ansehnlich, schön, herrlich, würdig. Superl. ˚स्वि꣫तम.\n — b〉 hoch angesehen, berühmt (meist von Personen). Superl. ˚स्वितम.\n— 2〉 f. ˚स्विना\n — a〉 eine best. Arterie.\n — b〉 *Name verschiedener Pflanzen: die wilde Baumwollenstaude, = महाज्योतिष्मती und यवतिक्ता RĀJAN. 3,65. 73.\n — c〉 N. pr. einer der Mütter im Gefolge Skandaʼs.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "yasogopi": [{"id": "yaSogopi", "headword": "यशोगोपि", "headword_slp1": "yaSogopi", "fold": "yasogopi", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "यशोगोपि m. N. pr. eines Scholiasten.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "yasoGna": [{"id": "yaSoGna", "headword": "यशोघ्न", "headword_slp1": "yaSoGna", "fold": "yasoGna", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "यशोघ्न Adj. den Ruhm vernichtend M. 8,127. BHĀG. P. 4,2,10. — ˚घ्नी s. u. यशोहन्.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "yasoda": [{"id": "yaSoda", "headword": "यशोद", "headword_slp1": "yaSoda", "fold": "yasoda", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "— 1〉 *Adj. Ansehen —, Ruhm verleihend.\n— 2〉 *m. Quecksilber RĀJAN. 13. 110 v. l. für यशोधा.\n— 3〉 f. आ N. pr.\n — a〉 der geistigen Tochter einer Klasse von Manen.\n — b〉 der Frau des Kuhhirten Nanda, der Kṛṣṇa gleich nach seiner Geburt als Kind untergeschoben wurde, und die daher als seine Mutter angesehen wird. ˚गर्भसंभूता Beiw. der Durgā.\n — c〉 der Gattin Mahāvīraʼs.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["यशोदः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["yaSodaH"]}, {"id": "yaSodA", "headword": "यशोदा", "headword_slp1": "yaSodA", "fold": "yasoda", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "यशोदा꣫\n— 1〉 Adj. Ansehen gebend.\n— 2〉 f. Bez. bestimmter Backsteine ĀPAST. ŚR. 17,5.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "yasodata": [{"id": "yaSodatta", "headword": "यशोदत्त", "headword_slp1": "yaSodatta", "fold": "yasodata", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "यशोदत्त m. N. pr. eines Mannes.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "yasodanandana": [{"id": "yaSodAnandana", "headword": "यशोदानन्दन", "headword_slp1": "yaSodAnandana", "fold": "yasodanandana", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "यशोदानन्दन (PAÑCAR. 4,3,115. 8,14) und ˚दासुत (Spr. 5567) m. Metron. Kṛṣṇaʼs.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "yasodasuta": [{"id": "yaSodAsuta", "headword": "यशोदासुत", "headword_slp1": "yaSodAsuta", "fold": "yasodasuta", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "यशोदानन्दन (PAÑCAR. 4,3,115. 8,14) und ˚दासुत (Spr. 5567) m. Metron. Kṛṣṇaʼs.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "yasodeva": [{"id": "yaSodeva", "headword": "यशोदेव", "headword_slp1": "yaSodeva", "fold": "yasodeva", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "यशोदेव N. pr.\n— 1〉 m.\n — a〉 eines buddh. Bhikṣu.\n — b〉 eines Sohnes des Rāmacandra.\n— 2〉 f. ई einer Tochter Vainateyaʼs.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "yasoDana": [{"id": "yaSoDana", "headword": "यशोधन", "headword_slp1": "yaSoDana", "fold": "yasoDana", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "— 1〉 adj. dessen Reichthum im Ruhm besteht, reich an Ruh, berühmt (Person).\n— 2〉 m. N. pr. eines Fürsten.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "yasoDara": [{"id": "yaSoDara", "headword": "यशोधर", "headword_slp1": "yaSoDara", "fold": "yasoDara", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch